{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-634370595085157242 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=634370595001205626&sectionId=634370595085157242)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWi0E6lAfS_text","label":"ggWi0E6lAfS_text","default":"<p>Not every meaningful memory comes from a big celebration.</p><p>Sometimes, it is a quiet afternoon with your family. A spontaneous road trip. Your child making everyone laugh. Your pet doing something completely unexpected. A simple dinner where everyone happened to be together.</p><p>These moments may not seem important when they happen.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But years later, they can become the memories you wish you could experience all over again.</p><p>That is what makes an unexpected photograph so special. It does not have to capture a perfect moment. It simply needs to capture <strong>a moment that means something to you.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With Memobrick, those everyday memories can become something more than a photograph sitting in your camera roll. They can become a personalized keepsake you can build, display, and enjoy for years.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We often associate keepsakes with major milestones.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Weddings.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Birthdays.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Graduations.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Anniversaries.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Christmas.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But life is made up of much more than celebrations.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>There are countless little moments that happen between those occasions. A family movie night. A weekend breakfast. A walk with your dog. A random trip to the beach. A funny moment at home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These moments may never make it into a scrapbook or photo album.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Yet they can become some of your favorite memories.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYfPM1SNQS_text","label":"ggYfPM1SNQS_text","default":"<p>The Ordinary Can Become Extraordinary</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrfu9Sl95Q_text","label":"ggrfu9Sl95Q_text","default":"<p>Think about an old photograph from several years ago.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe it was not taken for a special reason.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe someone simply grabbed their phone and took a picture.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At the time, nobody thought much about it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now, that photograph might remind you of people, places, or a period of life that has completely changed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is the interesting thing about memories.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>We do not always know which moments will become important to us later.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIyFqM9oJN_text","label":"ggIyFqM9oJN_text","default":"<p>Why Candid Photos Can Mean So Much</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNCTIcwED_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggrNCTIcwED_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Screenshot_2026-08-26_221719.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNCTIcwED_alt","label":"ggrNCTIcwED_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrNCTIcwED_title","label":"ggrNCTIcwED_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8DZ8toEDb_text","label":"gg8DZ8toEDb_text","default":"<p>Perfectly posed photographs have their place, but candid photographs often capture something different.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>They capture people being themselves.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A genuine laugh.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A funny expression.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A child being silly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A pet doing something ridiculous.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Friends enjoying a moment together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These photographs can feel more personal because they show what the moment actually felt like.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And sometimes, that is exactly the kind of memory worth turning into a keepsake.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjBxHO5SWu_text","label":"ggjBxHO5SWu_text","default":"<p>Turn an Unexpected Moment Into Something You Can Build</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAGDP2-GP1_text","label":"ggAGDP2-GP1_text","default":"<p>Your favorite memory does not have to stay inside your phone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick transforms your chosen photograph into a personalized brick mosaic that you can build piece by piece.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As the individual bricks come together, the image slowly becomes recognizable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What started as an ordinary photograph becomes something physical that you can interact with and display.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And the experience does not end when the mosaic is finished.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Every time you see it, you can remember the moment behind the picture.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Family life is full of moments that happen without planning.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe your children were playing together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe everyone was laughing around the dinner table.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe you took a random picture during a weekend at home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Maybe your family went somewhere without realizing how meaningful that day would eventually become.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those are the moments worth looking through your camera roll for.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You do not need to wait for the next big celebration to create a family keepsake.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Sometimes, the picture already exists.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1c7mTehVp_text","label":"gg1c7mTehVp_text","default":"<p>Even Your Pets Create Memories Worth Keeping</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDK6HVsEDN_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggDK6HVsEDN_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/1111111.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDK6HVsEDN_alt","label":"ggDK6HVsEDN_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDK6HVsEDN_title","label":"ggDK6HVsEDN_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0benTyPyh_text","label":"gg0benTyPyh_text","default":"<p>Our pets are part of our everyday lives, which means some of our favorite memories with them happen completely by accident.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A funny sleeping position.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A ridiculous expression.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A favorite spot on the couch.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A moment when they decided to join the family photograph.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>These little moments can capture their personality in a way that a perfectly planned photograph never could.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A favorite pet photograph can become a Memobrick that gives that personality a permanent place in your home.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBCdXdQM3Z_text","label":"ggBCdXdQM3Z_text","default":"<p>The Best Travel Memories Are Not Always the Famous Places</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiNyLORU8e_text","label":"ggiNyLORU8e_text","default":"<p>When we think about travel photography, we often think about landmarks.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But ask someone about their favorite travel memory, and they may tell you about something completely different.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Getting lost together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Laughing at a restaurant.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A funny moment in the hotel.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A random roadside stop.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Watching the sunset.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A spontaneous photograph taken when nobody was posing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The destination might be what gets you there.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The little moments are what you remember.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaTg8Ix0RI_text","label":"ggaTg8Ix0RI_text","default":"<p>A Gift They Will Not See Coming</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUpBU5DeWk_text","label":"ggUpBU5DeWk_text","default":"<p>Unexpected memories can also make wonderful personalized gifts.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Imagine giving your parents a Memobrick made from an old family photograph.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Or surprising your partner with a picture from your first trip together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Or giving a friend a mosaic made from a ridiculous photograph that still makes you laugh years later.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The recipient may not expect the photograph to become a gift.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That surprise is part of what makes it special.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You are not simply giving them something personalized.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You are giving them <strong>a memory they may have forgotten was worth keeping.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVA9dP6nTN_text","label":"ggVA9dP6nTN_text","default":"<p>What Photo Should You Look For?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggv52xfEl_s_text","label":"ggv52xfEl_s_text","default":"<p>You do not need to search for the most perfect photograph in your camera roll.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Instead, look for the one that makes you feel something.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ask yourself:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• Does this photo remind me of someone I love?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• Does it make me laugh?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• Does it remind me of an important time in my life?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• Does it capture a person, pet, or place that means something to me?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>• Would I want to see this moment again years from now?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If the answer is yes, you may have found your perfect keepsake photo.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEk5NJ16_O_text","label":"ggEk5NJ16_O_text","default":"<p>A Memory You Can Build Together</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMOl7lweXE_text","label":"ggMOl7lweXE_text","default":"<p>One of the things that makes Memobrick different from simply printing a photograph is the building experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You can build it alone, but you can also build it with the people who are part of the memory.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Parents and children can work on a family photograph together.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Couples can build a photograph from a favorite trip.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Friends can work on a picture that reminds them of an unforgettable experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As you build, you are not just recreating the photograph.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You are creating another memory around it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVb7uSJyub_text","label":"ggVb7uSJyub_text","default":"<p>Made to Be Remembered</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1_OQN1sBH_text","label":"gg1_OQN1sBH_text","default":"<p>A Memobrick does not have to represent the biggest event in your life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It can represent the little things that make life meaningful.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A laugh.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A hug.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A silly face.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A favorite pet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A family gathering.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A spontaneous adventure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A normal day that turned out to be anything but ordinary.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Those are the memories that make a house feel like home.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEoX4GWeEB_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggEoX4GWeEB_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/John_R._It_was_a_fun_relaxing_task._My_wife_and_I_are_thrilled_to_have_our_wedding_photo_in_such_an_interesting_style.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEoX4GWeEB_alt","label":"ggEoX4GWeEB_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEoX4GWeEB_title","label":"ggEoX4GWeEB_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggii5080P9G_text","label":"ggii5080P9G_text","default":"<p><strong>John R.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gglcGgYBoAb_text","label":"gglcGgYBoAb_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;It was a fun relaxing task. My wife and I are thrilled to have our wedding photo in such an interesting style</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr3vAGbYwy_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggr3vAGbYwy_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Aaryn_C._So_easy_to_understand_and_a_nice_relaxing_project_for_my_free_time._Can_t_wait_to_do_another_one.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr3vAGbYwy_alt","label":"ggr3vAGbYwy_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr3vAGbYwy_title","label":"ggr3vAGbYwy_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjBA9EPd6S_text","label":"ggjBA9EPd6S_text","default":"<p><strong>Aaryn C.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpWaWSEt8h_text","label":"ggpWaWSEt8h_text","default":"<p>So easy to understand and a nice relaxing project for my free time. Can't wait to do another one!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Candice_L._I_split_the_photo_in_half_so_I_could_get_2_of_the_60x20_so_I_could_fill_my_wall_more_and_its_turned_out_AMAZING.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_alt","label":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_title","label":"ggL5y_Oy0ur_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggUZSTpM54b_text","label":"ggUZSTpM54b_text","default":"<p><strong>Candice L.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl5uJy7tO1_text","label":"ggl5uJy7tO1_text","default":"<p>I split the photo in half so I could get 2 of the 60x20 so I could fill my wall more and its turned out AMAZING!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2qLRyhJkY_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg2qLRyhJkY_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/Jennifer_H._Was_a_fun_and_a_little_bit_challenging_project_to_do._Can_t_wait_to_do_another_one.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2qLRyhJkY_alt","label":"gg2qLRyhJkY_alt","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2qLRyhJkY_title","label":"gg2qLRyhJkY_title","default":"Customize Memobrick Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYWvnOapW__text","label"